								<fig id="e01849">
									<image href="images/P_SP327_B00_013_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01850">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Charging</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>The engine and the regenerative braking system charge the high voltage battery (engine &amp; wheel to battery).</p>
		</section>
